{"parentUuid":"f7d7d938-9572-4f62-bb3c-f35498e6f873","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"e83b6a4f-63a8-4fe4-afcd-e7857787d75e","agentId":"ae7f316477361ec0a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QRedpoRFUpditBWBwqKGqU","type":"tool_result","content":"claim--parachute-resistance-tradeoffs-for-dynamic-correspondence.md\nframework--five-criteria-of-dynamic-correspondence.md\nframework--specific-correspondence-of-the-training-effect-four-tasks.md\nheuristic--dynamic-correspondence-means-matching-motor-characteristics-not-copying-the-sport-movement.md\nheuristic--rfd-as-correspondence-criterion-and-impulse-cannot-compare-movements.md\n- The Principle of Dynamic Correspondence (Verkhoshansky), matching amplitude/direction of movement, region of force production, dynamics of effort, rate/timing of force production, and regime of muscular work to the sport skill, governs whether an exercise actually transfers, rather than surface resemblance to the sport. **Expl","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e09c407e-906a-4738-85ff-6637bbbe7009","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:23:32.846Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"claim--parachute-resistance-tradeoffs-for-dynamic-correspondence.md\nframework--five-criteria-of-dynamic-correspondence.md\nframework--specific-correspondence-of-the-training-effect-four-tasks.md\nheuristic--dynamic-correspondence-means-matching-motor-characteristics-not-copying-the-sport-movement.md\nheuristic--rfd-as-correspondence-criterion-and-impulse-cannot-compare-movements.md\n- The Principle of Dynamic Correspondence (Verkhoshansky), matching amplitude/direction of movement, region of force production, dynamics of effort, rate/timing of force production, and regime of muscular work to the sport skill, governs whether an exercise actually transfers, rather than surface resemblance to the sport. **Expl","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f7d7d938-9572-4f62-bb3c-f35498e6f873","sessionK